<div class="modal fade bulk-programming-modal" id="bulkProgrammingModal" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="bulkProgrammingTitle" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="modal-dialog modal-xl modal-dialog-scrollable"><div class="modal-content">
    <div class="modal-header bulk-modal-head"><h5 class="modal-title" id="bulkProgrammingTitle"><i class="bi bi-calendar2-week me-2"></i>Programación masiva</h5><button type="button" class="btn-close btn-close-white" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Cerrar"></button></div>
    <div class="modal-body">
      <div class="row g-3 align-items-end"><div class="col-md-4"><label class="form-label" for="bulkStart">Fecha de inicio *</label><input class="form-control form-control-sm" id="bulkStart" type="date" min="{{ today('America/Lima')->toDateString() }}"></div><div class="col-md-4"><label class="form-label" for="bulkEnd">Fecha de fin *</label><input class="form-control form-control-sm" id="bulkEnd" type="date" min="{{ today('America/Lima')->toDateString() }}"></div><div class="col-md-4 d-grid"><button class="btn btn-outline-success btn-sm" type="button" id="bulkLoad"><i class="bi bi-arrow-repeat me-1"></i>Consultar grupos</button></div></div>
      <div class="mt-3"><span class="form-label d-block mb-2">Filtrar por turno:</span><div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3" id="bulkShiftFilters"><div class="form-check"><input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" value="Mañana" id="bulkShiftMorning" checked><label class="form-check-label" for="bulkShiftMorning">Mañana</label></div><div class="form-check"><input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" value="Tarde" id="bulkShiftAfternoon" checked><label class="form-check-label" for="bulkShiftAfternoon">Tarde</label></div><div class="form-check"><input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" value="Noche" id="bulkShiftNight" checked><label class="form-check-label" for="bulkShiftNight">Noche</label></div></div><div class="form-text">Solo los turnos marcados se validarán y se generarán.</div></div>
      <h6 class="bulk-section-title"><i class="bi bi-calendar-x me-1"></i>Días feriados en el rango seleccionado</h6><div class="bulk-holiday-panel"><div class="small mb-2"><strong class="text-primary">Feriados encontrados:</strong> Seleccione los que NO desea programar.</div><div id="bulkHolidays" class="bulk-holiday-list">Seleccione un rango de fechas.</div></div>
      <h6 class="bulk-section-title mb-0">Grupos de trabajo</h6><p class="small text-muted mt-2 mb-2" id="bulkConflictHint">Cada tarjeta indicará directamente los conflictos que debes corregir.</p><div class="row g-2" id="bulkGroups"></div>
      <section id="bulkReport" class="d-none"><h6 class="bulk-report-title">Resultado de validación general</h6><div id="bulkReportItems"></div></section>
    </div>
    <div class="modal-footer bulk-footer"><button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Cancelar</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-success" id="bulkValidate" disabled><i class="bi bi-check-circle me-1"></i>Validar disponibilidad</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-success" id="bulkGenerate" disabled><i class="bi bi-calendar-check me-1"></i>Generar programación</button></div>
  </div></div>
</div>
